{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep7/quest_story/17216020.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216020","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721602001:0":{"text":"사령관님, 돌아오셨군요. 상층 지구 호위는 순조로우셨나요?","source_cn":"司令，您回来了。上城区的护卫任务还顺利吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1396290F2DFCFDF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721602002:0":{"text":"왕자님께서는 무사히 왕궁으로 돌아가셨고 그쪽 순찰을 강화했다. 너는 오늘 휴가였던 걸로 기억하는데, 아직 돌아가지 않았나?","source_cn":"王子殿下已安全返回王宫。我也加强了那边的巡防。我记得你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F79FB4460F8A9A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721602003:0":{"text":"...아버지, 고대의 전당과 페기의 실종 사건에 대해 드리고 싶은 말씀이 있어요. 조사에 참여하게 해주세요!","source_cn":"……父亲，我想跟你谈谈圣古堂和佩吉的失踪案，我请求参与调查！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F9015A7CB848053","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721602004:2":{"text":"왕궁에서 이미 분명히 말했다고 생각했는데. 이번 일은 멀린 님과 내가 맡는다.","source_cn":"我记得我在王宫里已经说得很清楚了，这件事由我和梅林阁下...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF851005BEC5A963E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"왕궁에서 이미 분명히 말했다고 생각했는데. 이번 일은 멀린 님과 내가 맡는다.","female":"왕궁에서 이미 분명히 말했다고 생각했는데. 이번 일은 멀린 님과 내가 맡는다.","variant_male_record_index":"227871","variant_female_record_index":"227872","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721602005:0":{"text":"네 임무는 주둔지에 남아 일상 치안 업무를 처리하는 것이지. 왜? 이제 내 명령은 무시하기로 한 건가?","source_cn":"你的任务是待在驻地，处理日常治安事件。怎么？我的命令现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAADD38D0630A72F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721602006:0":{"text":"이건 부당해요! 아버지, 저는 근위대 1분대장입니다. 왕실의 구성원이 실종되었다면 제게도 수색할 의무가 있다고요!","source_cn":"这不合理！父亲，我是守备军第一分队的队长，王室成员失踪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EE9CE52B0B58A53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721602007:0":{"text":"게다가 페기는 제 친구이기도 해요!","source_cn":"更何况，佩吉不仅仅是公主，她还是我的朋友！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5866070370D018CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721602008:0":{"text":"분대장이기 때문에 더더욱 내 명령에 복종해야 하는 거다.","source_cn":"正因为你是队长，你才更要服从命令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EA8FB53B413CDCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721602009:2":{"text":"사람들 앞에서 고대의 전당 전체를 사라지게 할 수 있는 자다... 그 뒤에 얽힌 세력, 수단, 심지어 정치적 암투까지... 네가 감당할 수 있는 게 아니야!","source_cn":"能够让整座圣古堂在所有人面前消失……这背后牵扯的势力、...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47BBCBBB8CE4837B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721602010:0":{"text":"그게 뭐 어때서요?! 근위대의 임무는 위협에 맞서는 거 아닌가요?","source_cn":"那又如何？！守备军的职责不就是面对威胁吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC39DFF399AA9B37A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721602011:0":{"text":"적들이 강하고 위험한 수작을 부린다고 해서, 물러서야만 합니까?","source_cn":"难道因为敌人可能强大、危险或者手段诡异，我们就能躲起来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA872A69A563F7124","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721602012:0":{"text":"왜... 제게 능력이 있다는 걸 믿어주시지 않는 거예요?","source_cn":"为什么……您总是不肯相信我是有能力的……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB77F77D67BC63E7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721602013:2":{"text":"음모 앞에서 네 용기나 능력 따위는 아무 가치도 없기 때문이다! 내가 근위대 사령관인 이상, 네가 조사에 참여하는 일은 절대 없다!","source_cn":"因为你的勇敢或者能力在阴谋面前一文不值！只要我还是守备...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A8D22F68B720521","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1721602014:0":{"text":"돌아가라, 귀네스 분대장!","source_cn":"你可以回家了，格温妮丝队长！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x097326378747643D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1721602015:0":{"text":"...네, 사령관님. 원하시는 대로 “말 잘 듣는” 딸이 되도록 노력하겠습니다.","source_cn":"……遵命，司令阁下。如您所愿，我会努力做一个“听话”的女儿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6251D9557178122A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:亨德里克":{"text":"헨드릭","source":"亨德里克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep7/quest_story/17216030.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216030","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1721603001:0":{"text":"...하아, 여기를 벗어나야겠어.","source_cn":"……呼，我得离开这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A079C087DE647F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1721603002:0":{"text":"광장에 가서 한숨 돌리자.","source_cn":"去广场那里散散心吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBC2C513603D4B12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep7/quest_story/17216040.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216040","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721604001:1":{"text":"저기는... 큐티 랜덤 박스 노점이네.","source_cn":"那里是，萌友宝盒的摊位。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70C08BDB8C43F8E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721604002:1":{"text":"하나 뽑아볼까? 돈이라도 쓰면 기분이 조금 좋아지겠지!","source_cn":"去抽抽看吧，就当是花钱消气了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CA573EC1C3B94E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep7/quest_story/17216050.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216050","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721605001:1":{"text":"귀네스 경, 정말 대단하세요! 이런 실력과 운이라니, 역시 근위대 분대장다우시네요!","source_cn":"格温妮丝小姐，你太厉害了！这实力和运气，不愧是守备军的队长！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F2F58B7DB6F451E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721605002:1":{"text":"오늘 다 나쁜 일만 있는 건 아니네요. 적어도 랜덤 박스는 노력한 만큼 보상을 받았으니까요.","source_cn":"看来，我今天遇见的也不全是坏事。至少在宝盒这里，付出就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x450A91BE3B6C31A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721605003:1":{"text":"당연하죠! 귀네스 경처럼 배짱과 운을 가지신 분이라면 뭐든 다 잘될 거예요!","source_cn":"那是当然！像您这样既有魄力又有运气的人，无论做什么肯定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x719664224A38DBE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721605004:1":{"text":"“전리품” 잘 챙기시고요, 다음에 또 오세요!","source_cn":"记得拿好您的“战利品”，欢迎下次光临哟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66D9EBC24C3965F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:秘银职员爱丽丝":{"text":"미스릴 직원 앨리스","source":"秘银职员爱丽丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep7/quest_story/17216060.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216060","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1721606001:0":{"text":"기분이 훨씬 나아졌어. 주둔지로 돌아가서 할 일을 마저 하자.","source_cn":"好受了很多，可以回驻地继续工作了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C75ECCC266F17AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep7/quest_story/17216070.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216070","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1721607001:1":{"text":"다들 에이르랑 친하게 지내도록!","source_cn":"你们几个可以陪艾尔了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x498BB7F47F6E6DC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1721607002:0":{"text":"호른, 여기 근위대 주둔지 맞아?","source_cn":"呼伦，这还是守备军驻地吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BE7288202440BAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721607003:0":{"text":"응? 여기 귀족 영애의 침실 아니었어?","source_cn":"我还以为是哪个贵族小姐的卧室！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF982B19FE203FE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721607004:1":{"text":"하하하하! 호른, 그런 말 하지 마. 근데 뭐... 진짜 귀족 영애가 맞긴 하잖아?","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈！呼伦，你别这么说。毕竟人家可是正牌的贵族小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE395A567A69663DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721607005:1":{"text":"활이나 만지작거리며 사는 게 얼마나 힘들겠어. 이런 유치한 짓이라도 해야 좀 낫겠지.","source_cn":"摆弄弓箭的日子太苦了，肯定得玩点童趣的东西找找安慰嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE88DFF7D3C4497C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721607006:1":{"text":"인형 놀이? 이런 건 세 살짜리나 갖고 노는 거 아닌가?","source_cn":"安慰玩偶嘛？这种软趴趴的东西，三岁小孩才玩吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B15E3565B1D76EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721607007:1":{"text":"지금은 자유 시간이야. 내 개인 물품에 간섭하지 말도록 해.","source_cn":"现在是自由活动时间。我的私人物品与你们无关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E219859AF761DE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721607008:1":{"text":"그렇게 한가하면 완전군장하고 주둔지 두 바퀴 뛰게 해 줄까?","source_cn":"如果太闲，我不介意让你们加两组负重跑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2F31B5BBAB00CF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721607009:2":{"text":"에이, 귀네스 분대장님. 농담이에요~ 그냥... 이게 근위대 주둔지랑 좀 안 어울린다고 생각해서 말이죠.","source_cn":"别这么严肃嘛，格温妮丝队长。我们只是觉得……这东西和守...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9F704B0741C0ED9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721607010:1":{"text":"근위대는 군인이고 전사 아닙니까. 진짜 군인은 저희처럼 강인하고 건장한 사람들이지, 이런 인형 놀이를 하진 않거든요.","source_cn":"毕竟您是守备军，是战士。真正的军人，应该像我们一样强壮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78C75C57D3C4C58D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721607011:1":{"text":"솔직히 근위대랑은 안 어울리는 모습이죠!","source_cn":"你这样子，可没有一点守备军的模样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0230132F0070471","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721607012:1":{"text":"근위대와 어울리는 모습? 너희처럼 편견만 가득하고 무례함으로 무능을 감추는 것이 근위대의 기준이라는 말인가?","source_cn":"守备军的模样？你是说，像你们这样满嘴偏见、只会用粗鲁来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21E95E212DB6A1C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1721607013:2":{"text":"이익...! 누, 누가 무능하다고...! 분대장 달았다고 뭐, 무서워할 줄 압니까?!","source_cn":"你——！说谁无能？！别以为你是队长我们就怕你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5FA608C19D58570","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1721607014:1":{"text":"사령관님 덕분에 그 자리에 앉은 주제에! 지금 근위대가 뭔지 가르치려고 드는 겁니까?","source_cn":"你不就是靠着你父亲才坐上这个位置的吗？还敢教训我们什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21DF520B71C89AE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1721607015:1":{"text":"그렇게 자신 있다면 한번 보여주시죠? 설마 아끼는 인형이 망가질까 봐 겁이라도 나신 건...","source_cn":"既然队长这么自信，不如让我们见识一下？还是说，您怕弄坏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DE50C2AB865FEA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1721607016:1":{"text":"좋아, 너희가 근위대라는 직책에 큰 오해를 하고 있는 모양이니... 친히 가르쳐 주지. 시간 아까우니까 같이 덤벼.","source_cn":"很好。既然你们对守备军这个词有这么大的误解，那我就免费...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34B25351A41EBB4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1721607017:1":{"text":"분명 먼저 말씀하신 겁니다? 나중에 쪽수로 밀어붙였다고 울지나 마시죠!","source_cn":"这可是你自找的！别怪我们以多欺少！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15F729AD92210590","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:守备军盖伊":{"text":"근위대원 가이","source":"守备军盖伊","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:守备军呼伦":{"text":"근위대원 호른","source":"守备军呼伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep7/quest_story/17216090.json":{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17216090","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17216090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721609001:0":{"text":"너희가 말하는 근위대의 “기준”에 문제가 있는 것 같네. 인형 놀이나 하는 나한테도 못 이기면서, 무슨 자격으로 근위대를 정의하려 드는 거지?","source_cn":"看来，你们的标准出了点问题。连我这个玩玩偶的人都打不过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DF02B7CCAB0FD0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721609002:0":{"text":"이... 이건 말도 안 돼... 분명...","source_cn":"这……这不可能……你明明是个……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26F8EFB496791141","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721609003:0":{"text":"잘 들어! 근위대에 정해진 모습 따위는 없다. 지켜야 할 사람을 지키고, 이겨야 할 싸움을 이기는 것. 그게 바로 근위대다!","source_cn":"听好了！守备军没有标准的模样，只要能守护该守护的人，只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3F889171DE0AEAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721609004:0":{"text":"이견 있나?","source_cn":"还有人有异议吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB8D9620D065E39F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721609005:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721609006:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721609007:0":{"text":"졌으면 규칙대로 해야지. 내일 아침 완전군장 뜀걸음 20바퀴 추가.","source_cn":"既然输了，就按规矩办。明早负重跑20圈。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37A14F2F4E47BCB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721609008:2":{"text":"...네.","source_cn":"……是。<key:dialog3>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACCA27AAFC18A113","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721609009:0":{"text":"...알겠습니다.","source_cn":"……遵命。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3D78BE0F04804AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721609010:0":{"text":"가이와 호른은 서로 부축하며 초라하게 떠났고, 훈련장에는 다시 귀네스만 남았다.","source_cn":"盖伊和呼伦相互搀扶着狼狈离开，训练场又只剩下的格温妮丝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB75E57D7BC4A19EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721609011:1":{"text":"(가이와 호른의 말이 듣기 좋은 건 아니지만, “진짜 귀족 영애”라니... 덕분에 하나 떠오르는 게 있네.)","source_cn":"（虽说盖伊和呼伦说的话并不好听，不过正牌的贵族小姐么…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEE5941846D3993B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721609012:1":{"text":"(아버지는 내가 근위대 분대장으로서 조사에 참여하는 걸 금지하셨지만... 귀족 영애인 귀네스가 사람들을 초대해 티타임을 즐기는 것까지 막을 수는 없겠지?)","source_cn":"（父亲禁止我以守备军的身份介入调查，但是……他可没办法...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF41DB4EA8E90BEFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1721609013:1":{"text":"(사바나의 정보는 회의 테이블에서만 오가는 게 아니야. 더 은밀한 소식은 찻잔을 사이에 두고 퍼지기도 하지...)","source_cn":"（赛凡纳有些情报是流通在会议桌之上，可还有更多更隐秘的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA506BC1066A732E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:15:1721609014:1":{"te