ed","hash_xxh64":"0xA40D01B598BF9807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1721611020:1":{"text":"맞아요, 맞아. 화내지 말아요. 귀네스는 공주님과 친하니까... 이 이야기는 그만 하죠!","source_cn":"是啊是啊，别生气嘛。我们知道你跟佩吉公主关系好，不说这个了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64C07E17D1596FAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1721611021:1":{"text":"하지만 솔직히 말해서 안타까운 일이지만, 사라진 건 공주님뿐이에요. <style=\"highlight\">오리안 왕자님</style>만 무사하면 되지 않겠어요?","source_cn":"不过说实话，虽然佩吉出事很遗憾，但也就是少了一个公主而...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09966B0F9ABE93EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1721611022:1":{"text":"레오프론 제국의 미래는 왕자님께 달려 있어요. 왕자님만 건재하시면 제국은 흔들리지 않을 거예요.","source_cn":"耀光帝国的未来可是系在王子殿下身上的，只要他还在，耀光...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDBBB59FBA4C318A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1721611023:1":{"text":"듀라 님이시여! 하지만 맞는 말이에요. 오리안 왕자님은 “완벽” 그 자체시니까요!","source_cn":"艾雅在上，这倒是真的。奥利安殿下简直是完美的化身！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3EAAEFE01914547","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1721611024:1":{"text":"사냥 행사에 참석해 본 적 있지요? 말을 타는 왕자님의 