,"story_id":"17216130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721613001:1":{"text":"분대장님! 근위대원 마틴, 보고드립니다!","source_cn":"队长！守备军马丁报告！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C9B1DF9424847CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721613002:1":{"text":"무슨 일이지?","source_cn":"什么事？<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4A82C2996DB4982","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721613003:1":{"text":"사령관님의 부관이 보낸 물건입니다. 분대장님께 직접 전하라고 하셨습니다!","source_cn":"队长！这是司令的副官送来的，指名要亲手交给您！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC421C8ECC296A51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:4::0":{"text":"벨벳 트랩 초대장","source_cn":"丝绒陷阱邀请函","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7DF81D2D168F9C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721613004:0":{"text":"귀네스는 봉투를 열고 은은한 향이 나는 초대장을 꺼냈다. 매우 고급스러운 재질의 초대장에는 우아한 필기체로 <style=\"highlight\">벨벳 트랩</style>이라는 식당 이름이 적혀 있었다.","source_cn":"格温妮丝打开信封，抽出了一张散发着香薰味道的邀请函。邀...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EFF5A93D5AAEE74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721613005:1"